{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 819 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Bacteriostatic water has been on FDA's shortage list since 2021-12-03 and remains listed as of 2026-10-21, a span of 59 months.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Our product labels name Hospira, Inc. (FEI 1021343) and Pfizer Healthcare India Private Limited (FEI 3008316085) as registered manufacturing plants.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E36"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1106244 at the Pfizer Healthcare India plant ended 2019-09-06 and was classified OAI, with the classification letter dated 2020-05-25 — 819 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2021-12-03.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the same Pfizer Healthcare India plant on 2020-03-25, 618 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E35"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hospira, Inc. plant (FEI 1925262) received an OAI classification letter dated 2020-04-22, 590 days before the shortage posting, and another OAI inspection (1064827) ended 2018-08-15 with classification letter 2020-04-22.",
      "cites": ["D8", "E23"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory shows Corvale East has 40 vials (11.3 days on hand) and Corvale General has 83 vials (19.5 days on hand) of the 30 mL presentation.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑ranked alternate manufacturer is Fujian Genohope Biotech Ltd., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    }
  ]
}
